      "message": "fix(ui): --help lists every start option and variable\n\nOne table in cli_options.rs drives the option check and the help text.\n--help/-h and --version exit 0 before any window or GPU device. An unknown\noption exits 2 and names itself. Adds a user guide page.\n\nFixes #2082\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
